 cmd/kuraka.go                                 | 26 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../apps/widget/src/components/ChatMenu.vue   |  4 ++-
 .../widget/src/components/PreChatForm.vue     | 14 ++++++++--
 4 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

